      <section id="notes">
        <div class="section-label">little things / page 02</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">DESIGN NOTES</h2>
        <div class="timeline">
          <article class="note">
            <div class="date">01 / KEEP IT HUMAN</div>
            <h3>Details matter.</h3>
            <p>Good design isn't only about looking polished. It's about anticipating the tiny moments where someone might hesitate, wonder, or get stuck.</p>
          </article>
